  "summary": "作者解释武曲旺宫会吉可显将星作用，丑未与贪狼同宫，辰戌独坐而贪狼在对宫。引古注列地区、性别与年干条件，以及甲丑三合科权禄、庚未武曲化权、癸辰魁钺夹命等例。末尾丙辰命例断裂，未补其结论。",
  "summary_en": "The author says Wu Qu in a strong palace with many benefics can express its general-like qualities. It shares Chou or Wei with Tan Lang, while at Chen or Xu it is alone and Tan Lang is opposite. Quoted annotations distinguish regional, sex and birth-stem conditions, including Jia-Chou transformations, Geng-Wei Wu Qu Hua Quan and Gui-Chen Kui Yue flanking. The final Bing-Chen example is incomplete and its conclusion is not supplied.",
